{"type":"message_update","assistantMessageEvent":{"type":"toolcall_start","contentIndex":1,"partial":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me write the comprehensive summary.txt documenting all findings all findings","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"chatcmpl-tool-a5944b4f1cd2115f","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"Firmware Unpacking Summary\n=========================\n\nInput File\n----------\nFile: /home/icsl/sothoth/13-secflow-service/image_build/secflow-app-firmware-unpacker/targets/demo2/S6730_V200R024C00SPC500.cc\nSize: 182,819,840 bytes (174.36 MB)\nFormat: Huawei S6730 .cc firmware (magic bytes: 00000000)\nDevice: Huawei S6730 switch\n\nOutput Directory\n----------------\n/home/icsl/sothoth/13-secflow-service/image_build/secflow-app-firmware-unpacker/unpacked-demo2-skill-rerun-unified/S6730_V200R024C00SPC500.cc/output\n\nTools Used\n----------\n1. binwalk - Signature analysis and filesystem identification\n2. dd - Byte-accurate extraction of known components\n3. file - File type verification of extracted artifacts\n\nExtraction Commands\n-------------------\n1. binwalk analysis:\n   binwalk \"$firmware\" > \"$output/binwalk.txt\"\n\n2. Extract main xz-compressed SquashFS rootfs:\n   dd if=\"$firmware\" of=\"$output/artifacts/rootfs_xz.squashfs\" bs=4M iflag=skip_bytes,count_bytes skip=41668 count=123581704 status=none\n\n3. Extract gzip-compressed SquashFS #1:\n   dd if=\"$firmware\" of=\"$output/artifacts/rootfs_gzip1.squashfs\" bs=4M iflag=skip_bytes,count_bytes skip=123648804 count=8111913 status=none\n\n4. Extract gzip-compressed SquashFS #2:\n   dd if=\"$firmware\" of=\"$output/artifacts/rootfs_gzip2.squashfs\" bs=4M iflag=skip_bytes,count_bytes skip=135199940 count=7491332 status=none\n\n5. Extract Linux kernel uImage:\n   dd if=\"$firmware\" of=\"$output/artifacts/uImage_kernel\" bs=4M iflag=skip_bytes,count_bytes skip=142746844 count=2524096 status=none\n\n6. Extract ramdisk uImage: