reation: 2024-09-28 18:20:27\n   - Output: $output/artifacts/uImage_ramdisk\n\nAdditional Signatures Detected (Not Extracted)\n----------------------------------------------\n- LZMA compressed data blocks at offsets: 0x1984, 0x3B7C, 0x5D74, 0x7F6C\n- Multiple PKCS signatures and X.509 certificates in DER format (signature verification metadata)\n- UEFI PI Firmware Volumes at offsets: 0x7DBC5D4, 0x7E0C5D4, 0x7F5E694\n- SHA256 hash constants table\n- Large LZMA compressed data at offset 0x7E2AE04 (uncompressed size: 6,717,392 bytes)\n\nFirmware Characteristics\n------------------------\n- Platform: Huawei S6730 series network switch\n- Architecture: ARM\n- Firmware Version: V200R024C00SPC500\n- Build Date: September 2024\n- Bootloader: u-boot (uImage format)\n- Filesystem Format: Multiple SquashFS images with different compression schemes (xz and gzip)\n- Security: Contains PKCS signatures and X.509 certificates for firmware verification\n\nArtifact Verification\n---------------------\nAll extracted artifacts verified using file command:\n- rootfs_xz.squashfs: Valid SquashFS v4.0, xz compressed\n- rootfs_gzip1.squashfs: Valid SquashFS v4.0, gzip compressed\n- rootfs_gzip2.squashfs: Valid SquashFS v4.0, gzip compressed\n- uImage_kernel: Valid u-boot legacy uImage, Linux/ARM kernel\n- uImage_ramdisk: Valid u-boot legacy uImage, Linux/ARM ramdisk\n\nTotal Extracted Size: 149,297,986 bytes (142.37 MB)\nExtraction Coverage: 81.6% of total firmware size (major components)\n\nNotes\n-----\n- The firmware uses multiple SquashFS images, likely representing different partitions or overlay filesystems\n- UEFI firmware volumes suggest the device supports UEFI boot specifications\n- Cryptographic signatures indicate the firmware is signed for integrity verification and anti-tampering\n- No nested archive extraction was performed to avoid output tree explosion\n- The root filesystems can be extracted using unsquashfs if needed: unsquashfs -d <dest_dir> <squashfs_file>\n\nSkill Reus